 "stimulus_html": "Use the pairwise comparison matrix in the given figure for the following exercises.<br>\n<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<figcaption>Pairwise Comparison Matrix for Candidates Q, R, S and T</figcaption>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/5432476ef4a0e5b6.png\" alt=\"A table shows the comparison between four candidates Q, R, S, and T. The data given in the table are as follows. The table shows four rows and five columns. The column headers are Runner and Opponent, Q, R, S, and T. Column one shows Q wins, R wins, S wins, and T wins. Column two shows Nil, R Q 1, S Q 2, and T Q 3. Column three shows Q R 3, Nil, S R 1, and T R 2. Column four shows Q S 2, R S 3, and T S 1. Column five shows Q T 1, R T 2, S T 3, and Nil.\">\n</figure>",
 "questions": [
